# Placeholder Art

This project will replace art later. Do not spend time on polished sprites, tiles, or VFX.

- New visuals should be simple placeholders: solid colors, 1px borders, basic shapes, or short labels
- Prefer generating textures in GDScript (`Image` / `ImageTexture`) or tiny PNGs under `Assets/sprites/`
- Keep atlas layouts stable (tile size, tile order) so final art can drop in without code changes
- Do not import or invent final character/tileset art unless the user provides it
